    fix: skip activity log rows when the ticket status is unchanged
    
    Reassigning a ticket or touching it on a reply triggers an updated event without a status change, so logOnlyDirty produced an activity row with an empty attribute_changes payload. Those rows showed up in the status history tab with no badges. dontLogEmptyChanges skips them, while real status transitions and the created event are still logged.
    
